<title>USA: Latin American Casinos sets repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Latin American Casinos sets repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH MIAMI BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latin American Casinos said Monday its board approved the buyback of up to 500,000 shares of stock.</p>
<p>The company has 3.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said repurchases can be made through open market transactions, privately negotiated transactions, or otherwise at prices and times determined by management.</p>
<p>The company also said it has set September 1 as the payment date for its special $0.05 dividend declared on May 14.</p>
<p>Latin American Casinos is a slot machine rental and company.</p>
</text>
